# i18n Conventions — SOGo

## Hard rule
NEVER hardcode strings in JSX. ESLint rule `react/jsx-no-literals` will fail the build.

## Correct pattern
```tsx
const t = useTranslations('NAMESPACE')
return <span>{t('MY_KEY')}</span>
